# Moxa ioThinx 45MR-1600.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioThinx 45MR-1600 — 16-channel DI (PNP sink)
# | 
# | Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP via ioThinx 4510 adapter, port 502
# | 
# | IMPORTANT: Addresses below are MODULE-RELATIVE. Actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address.
# | Slot base depends on which slot this module occupies in the ioThinx 4510 chassis.
# | Only ch0-3 support event counter mode; ch4-15 are standard DI only.
# | 
# | FC01 (coil R/W): diCounterStatus ch0-3 (4 BOOL, 0=Pause 1=Run),
# | diCounterOverflowFlagClear ch0-3 (4 BOOL, W=1 to clear)
# | FC02 (discrete input R): diStatus ch0-15 (16 BOOL, 0=OFF 1=ON),
# | diMode ch0-15 (16 BOOL, 0=DI 1=Counter), diCounterOverflowFlag ch0-3 (4 BOOL, 0=Normal 1=Overflow)
# | FC03 (holding R/W): see [[registers]] below
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioThinx 45MR-1600
@description=16-DI PNP sink input ioThinx 45MR slot module. Addresses are module-relative; actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address (slot base assigned dynamically by ioThinx 4510 chassis). Only ch0-3 support event counter mode; ch4-15 are DI-only. FC01: diCounterStatus ch0-3 (0=Pause 1=Run), diCounterOverflowFlagClear ch0-3 (W=1 to clear). FC02: diStatus ch0-15, diMode ch0-15 (0=DI 1=Counter), diCounterOverflowFlag ch0-3. FC03: diCounterValue ch0-3 u64 4-words/ch (rel 0-15), diCounterStatusAll bitmask (rel 16), diCounterOverflowFlagClearAll (rel 17). FC04: diStatusAll (1 WORD), diCounterOverflowFlagAll (1 WORD), diModeAll (1 WORD).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iothinx-45mr-1600.toml; Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

